      "rowId": "cmnlnfz4h00631x3qd69ajim7",
      "oldSourceId": "1237",
      "sourceText": "え、それってプロポーズ？",
      "newSourceId": "b262491d-c752-4008-b68c-72bc338a6192::1237",
      "newSourceType": "AUDIO_DIALOGUE",
      "matched": true
    },
    {
      "table": "VocabularySentence",
      "rowId": "cmnu76rxv001dt33qbgqe830e",
      "oldSourceId": "3",
      "sourceText": "私の国、ベトナムは今まさに経済発展をしています。",
      "newSourceId": "3d087181-0b2a-4cd3-bca0-fb7193b2732d::3",
      "newSourceType": "AUDIO_DIALOGUE",
      "matched": true
    },
    {
      "table": "VocabularySentence",
      "rowId": "cmnlnzqes006a1x3q28crfkic",
      "oldSourceId": "1185",
      "sourceText": "1、先生、ご無沙汰しています。",
      "newSourceId": "dbd5c8ef-f774-478e-9950-ec3566f11674::1185",
      "newSourceType": "AUDIO_DIALOGUE",
      "matched": true
    },
    {
      "table": "VocabularySentence",
      "rowId": "cmnu77h2m001gt33q9ji9s9ae",
      "oldSourceId": "4",
      "sourceText": "しかし、これは光の部分で陰の部分は地方と都市部の経済格差や、",
      "newSourceId": "3d087181-0b2a-4cd3-bca0-fb7193b2732d::4",
      "newSourceType": "AUDIO_DIALOGUE",
      "matched": true
    },
    {
      "table": "VocabularySentence",
      "rowId": "cmnyldd180031np3qeudgobsb",
      "oldSourceId": "3",
      "sourceText": "父からは勉強に専念するように言われています。",
      "newSourceId": "3a316851-fcf7-4848-8ea6-284d2b1d1de7::3",
      "newSourceType": "AUDIO_DIALOGUE",
      "matched": true
    },
    {
      "table": "VocabularySentence",
      "rowId": "cmnsxcjge000it33qr61akdc8",
      "oldSourceId": "6",
      "sourceText": "その先輩から、留学生にとって学習環境が整っていることや、",
      "newSourceId": "5b33f3e3-d90a-4185-9814-bf02f8d72491::6",
      "newSourceType": "AUDIO_DIALOGUE",
      "matched": true
    },
    {
      "table": "VocabularySentence",
      "rowId": "cmnke4s49001m1x3q1wi2s43p",
      "oldSourceId": "1149",
      "sourceText": "「継続は力なり」ですね。",
      "newSourceId": "f2102cb3-0b43-4791-9370-e03c74ec5a73::1149",
      "newSourceType": "AUDIO_DIALOGUE",
      "matched": true
    },
    {
      "table": "VocabularySentence",
      "rowId": "cmnr5xo7f0005pn3qipke3nj7",
      "oldSourceId": "21",
      "sourceText": "はい、両立できるように頑張ります。",
      "newSourceId": "8b0e16f0-5bde-4890-a3db-a988aca429d0::21",
      "newSourceType": "AUDIO_DIALOGUE",
      "matched": true
    },
    {
      "table": "VocabularySentence",
      "rowId": "cmnylejen0034np3qm5lq05bo",
      "oldSourceId": "6",
      "sourceText": "生活費はアルバイト代を充てたいと思っています。",
      "newSourceId": "3a316851-fcf7-4848-8ea6-284d2b1d1de7::6",
      "newSourceType": "AUDIO_DIALOGUE",
      "matched": true
    },
    {
      "table": "VocabularySentence",
      "rowId": "cmo3t8ah900044m3q9attmcw9",
      "oldSourceId": "24",
      "sourceText": "#24收藏笔记编辑桜小路しずくは名の知れた主婦ブロガーbloggerで",
      "newSourceId": "1e2d815d-24f8-459a-91e2-1af9f72aa57f::3acb54dd-8f9d-48af-b82e-871a838a43c8",
      "newSourceType": "MEDIA_SUBTITLE_LINE",
      "matched": true
    },
    {
      "table": "VocabularySentence",
      "rowId": "cmo73qimp00071p3qedvoh3ja",
      "oldSourceId": "56",
      "sourceText": "新聞や雑誌の記事には経営についてもいろいろなヒントや教訓になることが書かれています。",
      "newSourceId": "8ba676c9-021f-4ea2-a34c-2f02fef31be2::56",
      "newSourceType": "AUDIO_DIALOGUE",
      "matched": true
    },
    {
      "table": "VocabularySentence",
      "rowId": "cmnylfk1f0037np3qgdoywmzm",
      "oldSourceId": "8",
      "sourceText": "3年間、国で働いて貯めた貯金があります。",
      "newSourceId": "3a316851-fcf7-4848-8ea6-284d2b1d1de7::8",
      "newSourceType": "AUDIO_DIALOGUE",
      "matched": true
    },
    {
      "table": "VocabularySentence",
      "rowId": "cmo73vgy1000c1p3qt55lfk22",
      "oldSourceId": "8",
      "sourceText": "えー、面接の前の筆記試験はどうでしたか。",
      "newSourceId": "8ba676c9-021f-4ea2-a34c-2f02fef31be2::8",
      "newSourceType": "AUDIO_DIALOGUE",
      "matched": true
    },
    {
      "table": "VocabularySentence",
      "rowId": "cmoslgs0j00032x3qc2klaya7",
      "oldSourceId": "12",
      "sourceText": "フィリピンは、公務員に最低週１回の在宅勤務を命じた。",
      "newSourceId": "92b18576-ef9d-4d1a-ae54-13e9f1fabb55::12",
      "newSourceType": "AUDIO_DIALOGUE",
      "matched": true
    },
    {
      "table": "VocabularySentence",
      "rowId": "cmosmd68n000w2x3qic78ggpb",
      "oldSourceId": "15",
      "sourceText": "航空機の利用自粛、公共交通の利用、高速道路の減速、車の乗り合い。",
      "newSourceId": "92b18576-ef9d-4d1a-ae54-13e9f1fabb55::15",
      "newSourceType": "AUDIO_DIALOGUE",
      "matched": true
    },
    {
      "table": "VocabularySentence",
      "rowId": "cmosmkvlh001n2x3qf8u9u8lz",
      "oldSourceId": "21",
      "sourceText": "海外では在宅勤務を推奨することで、車通勤で生じる石油の消費と負担を減らすべきだとの声も上がる。",
      "newSourceId": "92b18576-ef9d-4d1a-ae54-13e9f1fabb55::21",
      "newSourceType": "AUDIO_DIALOGUE",
      "matched": true
    },
    {
      "table": "VocabularySentence",
      "rowId": "cmo00xofb0003rt3qd17o4si7",
      "oldSourceId": "9",
      "sourceText": "TOEICやIELTSは受けたことがありませんが、",
      "newSourceId": "d0c28b3c-6801-4562-9a6d-e26297529ccb::9",
      "newSourceType": "AUDIO_DIALOGUE",
      "matched": true
    },
    {
      "table": "VocabularySentence",
      "rowId": "cmo3tb96q000a4m3qh1c1ump3",
      "oldSourceId": "28",
      "sourceText": "#28收藏笔记编辑逮捕されたのはしずくの夫 桜小こう路じ要一(よういち)",
      "newSourceId": "1e2d815d-24f8-459a-91e2-1af9f72aa57f::417d84f9-19e8-41c2-9444-5628a9005a62",
      "newSourceType": "MEDIA_SUBTITLE_LINE",
      "matched": true
    },
    {
      "table": "VocabularySentence",
      "rowId": "cmoa0mp96000q1p3qiro4dd8a",
      "oldSourceId": "28",
      "sourceText": "私は中小企業のマーケティングや市場戦略について学びたいと考えています。",
      "newSourceId": "8ba676c9-021f-4ea2-a34c-2f02fef31be2::28",
      "newSourceType": "AUDIO_DIALOGUE",
      "matched": true
    },
    {
      "table": "VocabularySentence",
      "rowId": "cmosmey3600152x3qzobygcuf",
      "oldSourceId": "17",
      "sourceText": "こうして世界を見渡すと日本は悠長にすぎやしないかと心配になってくる。",
      "newSourceId": "92b18576-ef9d-4d1a-ae54-13e9f1fabb55::17",
      "newSourceType": "AUDIO_DIALOGUE",
      "matched": true
    },
    {
      "table": "VocabularySentence",
      "rowId": "cmosmncll001t2x3qmqd5wt4w",
      "oldSourceId": "3",
      "sourceText": "不透明なイラン情勢で原油高が続くとみて、",
      "newSourceId": "92b18576-ef9d-4d1a-ae54-13e9f1fabb55::3",
      "newSourceType": "AUDIO_DIALOGUE",
      "matched": true
    },
    {
      "table": "VocabularySentence",
      "rowId": "cmo01dt8y000drt3qaf109k7t",
      "oldSourceId": "18",
      "sourceText": "持続可能な社会のためには環境について学ぶ必要があると思います。",
      "newSourceId": "5b33f3e3-d90a-4185-9814-bf02f8d72491::18",
      "newSourceType": "AUDIO_DIALOGUE",
      "matched": true
    },
    {
      "table": "VocabularySentence",
      "rowId": "cmoa0ncju000t1p3qu09azh29",
      "oldSourceId": "29",
      "sourceText": "卒業後はできれば日本で就職して経験をつみ、",
      "newSourceId": "8ba676c9-021f-4ea2-a34c-2f02fef31be2::29",
      "newSourceType": "AUDIO_DIALOGUE",
      "matched": true
    },
    {
      "table": "VocabularySentence",
      "rowId": "cmosm8poq000h2x3qz21ztuig",
      "oldSourceId": "9",
      "sourceText": "米国では傾いていた航空会社が経営破綻した。",
      "newSourceId": "92b18576-ef9d-4d1a-ae54-13e9f1fabb55::9",
      "newSourceType": "AUDIO_DIALOGUE",
      "matched": true
    },
    {
      "table": "VocabularySentence",
      "rowId": "cmosmfhyc00182x3q4wxin4en",
      "oldSourceId": "18",
      "sourceText": "政府は国民への節約要請は否定している。",
      "newSourceId": "92b18576-ef9d-4d1a-ae54-13e9f1fabb55::18",
      "newSourceType": "AUDIO_DIALOGUE",
      "matched": true
    },
    {
      "table": "VocabularySentence",
      "rowId": "cmo01hwkn000lrt3qw3w83ln1",
      "oldSourceId": "6",
      "sourceText": "日本は経済成長を続ける中でこうした課題を上手に克服してきました。",
      "newSourceId": "3d087181-0b2a-4cd3-bca0-fb7193b2732d::6",
      "newSourceType": "AUDIO_DIALOGUE",
      "matched": true
    },
    {
      "table": "VocabularySentence",
      "rowId": "cmoaudvr0000i4t3qsywp2ry2",
      "oldSourceId": "30",
      "sourceText": "その後、帰国して自分自身も起業したいと考えています。",
      "newSourceId": "8ba676c9-021f-4ea2-a34c-2f02fef31be2::30",
      "newSourceType": "AUDIO_DIALOGUE",
      "matched": true
    },
    {
      "table": "VocabularySentence",
      "rowId": "cmosm9m7p000n2x3qthefx4v0",
      "oldSourceId": "10",
      "sourceText": "日常生活がすでに大きく変化しているのが、中東への石油依存度が高いアジアの国々だ。",
      "newSourceId": "92b18576-ef9d-4d1a-ae54-13e9f1fabb55::10",
      "newSourceType": "AUDIO_DIALOGUE",
      "matched": true
    },
    {
      "table": "VocabularySentence",
      "rowId": "cmnh8ijhl0008sh3qqgved1oc",
      "oldSourceId": "579",
      "sourceText": "はい、私たちの団体は飼い主のいない保護猫と飼いたい方の橋渡しをしています。",
      "newSourceId": "54e3ac0f-6ab9-4a87-8991-e4f4ea03130e::579",
      "newSourceType": "AUDIO_DIALOGUE",
      "matched": true
    },
    {
      "table": "VocabularySentence",
      "rowId": "cmosmglb9001e2x3qsdds9zej",
      "oldSourceId": "19",
      "sourceText": "だが、サプライチェーンの現場では石油製品の大幅な値上げや新規受注の停止も起きている。",
      "newSourceId": "92b18576-ef9d-4d1a-ae54-13e9f1fabb55::19",
      "newSourceType": "AUDIO_DIALOGUE",
      "matched": true
    },
    {
      "table": "SentenceReview",
      "rowId": "cmng0ym9e0000s13qarii6dot",
      "oldSourceId": "592",
      "sourceText": "バスケットボールのサークルで来月合宿に行くんですけど、その手続きに参りました。",
      "newSourceId": "75e25b3d-95ec-46b7-8dfb-f599ebf10c5a::592",
      "newSourceType": "AUDIO_DIALOGUE",
      "matched": true
    },
    {
      "table": "SentenceReview",
      "rowId": "cmnk5xvjd000w1x3q7nd96uc6",
      "oldSourceId": "595",
      "sourceText": "申請には別途活動計画書も必要なんですが、お持ちですか？",
      "newSourceId": "75e25b3d-95ec-46b7-8dfb-f599ebf10c5a::595",
      "newSourceType": "AUDIO_DIALOGUE",
      "matched": true
    }
  ]
}
